=== 1. per-element operators on an array
n=4 [Ab] [Cd] [b] [d]
n=6 [a] [c] [AB] [CD] [ab] [cd]
n=8 [aB] [cd] [--] [--] [Ab] [cd] [ab] [cD]
n=1 [Ab Cd]
n=2 [Ab] [Cd]
n=2 [Hello] [HELLO]
=== 2. per-element operators on the positionals
n=2 [ 1] [q 2]
n=1 [ 1 q 2]
n=2 [p_1] [q_2]
n=2 [P 1] [Q 2]
n=2 [p ] [q ]
n=3 [1] [q] [2]
=== 3. positional slices
n=3 [p 1] [q 2] [r]
n=2 [q 2] [r]
n=1 [r]
n=2 [q 2] [r]
n=1 [p 1]
n=0
n=0
n=1 [p 1 q 2 r]
n=5 [p] [1] [q] [2] [r]
n=2 [preq 2] [rpost]
n=1 [q 2 r]
  ${@:0:1} is $0
=== 4. array slices
n=2 [y z] [w]
n=1 [w]
n=1 [y z]
n=1 [y z w]
n=2 [b] [c]
n=1 [a]
n=1 [c]
n=2 [b] [c]
n=0
n=2 [ello] [lo]
